data_hfs2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [hfs2].
# Deterministic full-basis P1 export of crystal_structures.toml.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 1T-HfS2 (CdI2-type, P-3m1 #164): one HfS2 formula unit per primitive
# hexagonal cell, with Hf on 1a and S on 2d. The product crystal reports
# a=b=3.62 A and c=5.80 A; Neal et al., npj 2D Mater. Appl. 5, 45 (2021)
# independently identify the vendor-grown bulk crystal as 1T P-3m1. The
# idealized octahedral coordinate z=0.25 gives an Hf-S bond of 2.54 A,
# consistent with the reported ~2.53 A. In the limiting basal case, one layer
# per cell means (001) is allowed (unlike the cancelled odd 00l of 2H TMDs).
# Validation: hfs2-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.62
_cell_length_b 3.62
_cell_length_c 5.8
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_occupancy
Hf1 Hf 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
S1 S 0.3333333333333333 0.6666666666666667 0.25 1.0
